.TH V7C2 1 "August 2026" "V7 toolchain" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
v7c2 \- V7 PDP-11 peephole optimizer (host-ported)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B v7c2
.I infile outfile
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I v7c2
is the optional object-code optimizer invoked by
.B v7cc \-O
between the code generator (
.BR v7c1 )
and the assembler.  It reads PDP-11 assembly from
.I infile
and writes the optimized assembly to
.IR outfile .
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR v7cc (1),
.IR v7c1 (1)
.SH BUGS
This is an internal pass; V7 documents it only as part of
.IR cc (1)
(the
.B \-O
option), so it has no man page of its own.  This page is provided for
completeness.
